sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgba(21,101,192,0.04) Internal zone
    participant H as Host code or a signal throw event
    participant E as Process Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (pre_signal, pre_event_subscription, pre_timer)
    participant W as Poller, any replica
  end
  rect rgba(224,242,241,0.8)
    Note over H,DB: TX0: record the signal, no fan-out in this transaction
    H->>E: broadcast(name, variables, signalId)
    E->>DB: insert pre_signal (thrown_at = now()), job SIGNAL_DELIVERY DUE
    E->>DB: COMMIT with the caller's writes
  end
  loop until no subscription with id greater than the cursor
    rect rgba(224,242,241,0.8)
      Note over W,DB: TXn: one batch of at most 100 subscriptions
      W->>DB: claim SIGNAL_DELIVERY with SKIP LOCKED and lease
      W->>DB: subscriptions of the signal name with created_at <= thrown_at and id > cursor, LIMIT 100
      loop each subscription, its instance locked in turn
        W->>DB: SELECT pre_instance FOR UPDATE, deliver, history SIGNAL_RECEIVED
      end
      W->>DB: job payload cursor = last id, COMMIT
    end
  end
  alt one instance fails in a batch
    W->>DB: incident on that instance, cursor still advances
  end
  W->>DB: job DONE, processes.signal.delivered.v1 with the count
